                <item>
                <title><![CDATA[【General Music Discussion】Spotify Downloader with FLAC option]]></title>
                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/spotify-downloader-with-flac-option.286327/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					I came across a free site that allows to download mp3 at 320kbps (full albums, playlists, or singles). Including embedded artwork and metadata. Or FLAC (singles only, no metadata or embedded artwork). <br>
<br>
<a href="https://spotidownloader.com/en" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">https://spotidownloader.com/en</a><br>
<br>
Do you think its real FLAC quality or just up-scaled?<br>
<br>
For a full album or playlist in mp3 you copy and paste a URL from Spotify, like this;<br>
<br>
<span data-s9e-mediaembed="spotify" style="display:inline-block;width:100%;max-width:320px"><span style="display:block;overflow:hidden;position:relative;padding-bottom:125%;padding-bottom:calc(100% + 80px)"><iframe allow="encrypted-media" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" scrolling="no" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/album/4a6NzYL1YHRUgx9e3YZI6I" style="border:0;height:100%;left:0;position:absolute;width:100%"></iframe></span></span><br>
<br>
Or a single song in mp3 or FLAC, like this;<br>
<br>
<span data-s9e-mediaembed="spotify" style="display:inline-block;width:100%;max-width:320px"><span style="display:block;overflow:hidden;position:relative;padding-bottom:125%;padding-bottom:calc(100% + 80px)"><iframe allow="encrypted-media" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" scrolling="no" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/track/53iuhJlwXhSER5J2IYYv1W" style="border:0;height:100%;left:0;position:absolute;width:100%"></iframe></span></span><br>
<br>
It works well. Sometimes you get an error, but usually it works.<br>
<br>
Enjoy!
					<div class="messageTextEndMarker">&nbsp;</div>
				</blockquote>
			</article>]]></description>
                <author><![CDATA[Thnx4FreeStuff]]></author>
